<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-CZECHS LEAD GERMANY 2-1 IN FED CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECHS LEAD GERMANY 2-1 IN FED CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech Republic took a 2-1 lead over Germany after the first reverse singles of a Fed Cup tennis World Group one match on Sunday:</p>
<p>Results (German names first):</p>
<p>Barbara Rittner lost to Ludmila Richterova 1-6 4-6</p>
<p>Played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Marlene Weingaertner beat Richterova 3-6 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Rittner lost to Adriana Gersi 4-6 2-6.</p>
</text>
